This library provides typed Dalvik bytecode emission for Morphe patches. Its
emitter vocabulary (move, iget, iput, sget, sput, moveResult, insertHook and the
type-driven opcode selectors) and parts of its helper set follow the Reseam
patch API:

    Reseam - Rust APK patching engine with a Kotlin patch API
    Copyright (C) 2026 AunAli K. <hello@auna.li>
    Licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later (SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later)

The implementation here is independent: it emits through Morphe's dexlib2
builder and takes its registers from Morphe's liveness search, rather than
growing the Dalvik frame the way Reseam's engine does. See the file header in
src/main/kotlin/app/crimera/bytecode/Block.kt.

